The '''Imperial Security Bureau control center''' was a command room located in the [[Imperial Security Bureau Central Office|ISB Central Office]]<ref name="Festive" /> by [[3 BBY]].<ref name="Timeline">{{Andor|Ever Been to Ghorman?}} dates the second arc of [[Andor Season 2|''Andor'' Season 2]] to [[3 BBY]].</ref> During that year, the control room was taken over by [[Major]] [[Lio Partagaz]] of the [[ISB Board]] and [[ISB Supervisor]] [[Dedra Meero]], in order to oversee the surveillance of a [[Ghorman Front]] ambush taking place in [[Palmo]]. The two officers were in contact with [[Imperial Bureau of Standards]] employee [[Syril Karn]], who had successfully infiltrated the Front and was relaying information about the rebels' actions.<ref name="Festive" />

